m international tuition support, check the earlier 2027 round deadline and build a research admission plan.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day25/application-workspace-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-23\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-23\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/monash-graduate-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does MGS automatically pay international tuition?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"MGS is a living stipend. The owner says international tuition scholarships can be packaged with it; require confirmation of the actual fee coverage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What changed for the 2027 international Round 1 deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The central Monash page moved the close from 31 March to 28 February 2027. Check the intended faculty and Australian-campus instructions before using the date.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I apply through admission-only and assume scholarship consideration later?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The owner requires scholarship applicants to use an open applicable scholarship round. Admission-only and scholarship consideration have different conditions.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L1c",false,"$L1d","$L1e"]}]
