1f:["$","p","Use the following original record before comparing an offer. Keep a tuition reduction in the fee column and a cash stipend in the living-cost column. Ask about the first payment as well as the annual amount. A package can be generous overall while leaving an arrival payment to make before cash is available.",{"children":"Use the following original record before comparing an offer. Keep a tuition reduction in the fee column and a cash stipend in the living-cost column. Ask about the first payment as well as the annual amount. A package can be generous overall while leaving an arrival payment to make before cash is available."}]
