21:["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.monash.edu/study/fees-scholarships/scholarships/find-a-scholarship/monash-graduate-scholarship-mgs",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.monash.edu/study/fees-scholarships/scholarships/find-a-scholarship/monash-graduate-scholarship-mgs","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Monash: Graduate Scholarship stipend and tuition boundary"}]]}],["$","span","https://www.monash.edu/graduate-research/study/scholarships/fees-scholarships/rates",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.monash.edu/graduate-research/study/scholarships/fees-scholarships/rates","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Monash:2027 stipend and allowance rates"}]]}]]]}]
22:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Use the 2027 Round 1 change, then check your faculty",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use the 2027 Round 1 change, then check your faculty"}],[["$","p","The central research-admissions page lists the international Round 1 period as 1 September–28 February and explicitly says the 2027 close moved forward from 31 March. Its dates apply to Australian campuses. Domestic rounds and the Malaysia or Indonesia directions are different routes. Do not copy the international close into every applicant’s calendar.",{"children":"The central research-admissions page lists the international Round 1 period as 1 September–28 February and explicitly says the 2027 close moved forward from 31 March. Its dates apply to Australian campuses. Domestic rounds and the Malaysia or Indonesia directions are different routes. Do not copy the international close into every applicant’s calendar."}],["$","p","The central and Science pages also differ on a later Round 3 close. That is a reason to check the intended faculty’s current instructions and resolve the applicable earlier requirement; it is not permission to choose the most convenient date. Keep a saved copy of the faculty guidance with the central round record. This guide does not infer a precise closing hour or one universal Round 3 date.",{"children":"The central and Science pages also differ on a later Round 3 close. That is a reason to check the intended faculty’s current instructions and resolve the applicable earlier requirement; it is not permission to choose the most convenient date. Keep a saved copy of the faculty guidance with the central round record. This guide does not infer a precise closing hour or one universal Round 3 date."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Use the 2027 Round 1 change, then check your faculty","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Use the 2027 Round 1 change, then check your faculty"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Record",{"scope":"col","children":"Record"}],["$","th","Check",{"scope":"col","children":"Check"}],["$","th","Action",{"scope":"col","children":"Action"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"International Round 1 for 2027"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Central close 28 February 2027"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check faculty requirements first"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Domestic applicant"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Separate domestic rounds"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Do not use international dates"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Different campus"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Separate international-campus guidance"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Rebuild the applicable schedule"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.monash.edu/graduate-research/study/apply",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.monash.edu/graduate-research/study/apply","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Monash: research admission, rounds and campus scope"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Prepare a research case before opening myApp",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare a research case before opening myApp"}],[["$","p","Start with a question you can explain rather than a list of university rankings. Read a potential group’s recent work and identify the connection between its methods and your preparation. A fictional candidate studying water sensors might distinguish field-data quality from sensor design, then choose which problem the intended group is equipped to supervise.",{"children":"Start with a question you can explain rather than a list of university rankings. Read a potential group’s recent work and identify the connection between its methods and your preparation. A fictional candidate studying water sensors might distinguish field-data quality from sensor design, then choose which problem the intended group is equipped to supervise."}],"$L26"],"$undefined","$L27","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L28","$undefined"]}],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]
