26:["$","p","Write a short fit record: research question, relevant earlier project, proposed evidence and missing training. Explain what you personally did in any group work. An honest methodological gap can become a reason for seeking training; inventing an advanced technique you have never used creates a claim you cannot defend. Follow the chosen faculty’s supervisor and proposal process, since the central page says expectations vary.",{"children":"Write a short fit record: research question, relevant earlier project, proposed evidence and missing training. Explain what you personally did in any group work. An honest methodological gap can become a reason for seeking training; inventing an advanced technique you have never used creates a claim you cannot defend. Follow the chosen faculty’s supervisor and proposal process, since the central page says expectations vary."}]
