29:["$","section","3-Keep admission and scholarship completion in one task list",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep admission and scholarship completion in one task list"}],[["$","p","The owner directs applicants to use myApp for course admission and scholarship applications; eligible applicants are considered for available graduate research scholarships rather than choosing each specific award. Already-enrolled students should follow their applicable process. An admission-only pathway is not evidence that a late scholarship request will be considered.",{"children":"The owner directs applicants to use myApp for course admission and scholarship applications; eligible applicants are considered for available graduate research scholarships rather than choosing each specific award. Already-enrolled students should follow their applicable process. An admission-only pathway is not evidence that a late scholarship request will be considered."}],["$","p","Build your checklist from the current course and faculty instructions. Keep academic records with their grading explanation, language evidence, proposal, CV and referee tasks in a controlled folder. Where certification or translation is required, verify the permitted method before paying for it. For each upload, retain the final filename and purpose; avoid sending a mix of draft and final versions that describe different projects.",{"children":"Build your checklist from the current course and faculty instructions. Keep academic records with their grading explanation, language evidence, proposal, CV and referee tasks in a controlled folder. Where certification or translation is required, verify the permitted method before paying for it. For each upload, retain the final filename and purpose; avoid sending a mix of draft and final versions that describe different projects."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.monash.edu/study/fees-scholarships/scholarships/find-a-scholarship/monash-graduate-scholarship-mgs",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.monash.edu/study/fees-scholarships/scholarships/find-a-scholarship/monash-graduate-scholarship-mgs","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Monash: Graduate Scholarship stipend and tuition boundary"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
2a:["$","section","4-Original example: compare an admission offer and a funding package",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Original example: compare an admission offer and a funding package"}],[["$","p","A fictional international applicant receives admission and sees an MGS result pending. They should not record the place as funded. Their first budget has tuition and living costs unresolved. A second scenario can show what would change if both a stipend and an appropriate fee award were later confirmed, clearly marking that outcome conditional.",{"children":"A fictional international applicant receives admission and sees an MGS result pending. They should not record the place as funded. Their first budget has tuition and living costs unresolved. A second scenario can show what would change if both a stipend and an appropriate fee award were later confirmed, clearly marking that outcome conditional."}],["$","p","When decisions arrive, compare their periods and conditions. A stipend award does not by itself establish a tuition waiver; a fee award does not supply rent cash. If one part is missing, ask the university which costs remain and whether there is an applicable alternative. Keep speculative outside work or a future award out of the confirmed funding total.",{"children":"When decisions arrive, compare their periods and conditions. A stipend award does not by itself establish a tuition waiver; a fee award does not supply rent cash. If one part is missing, ask the university which costs remain and whether there is an applicable alternative. Keep speculative outside work or a future award out of the confirmed funding total."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original example: compare an admission offer and a funding package","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original example: compare an admission offer and a funding package"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Decision state",{"scope":"col","children":"Decision state"}],["$","th","What is established",{"scope":"col","children":"What is established"}],["$","th","What remains",{"scope":"col","children":"What remains"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Admission only"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Academic place offered"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Funding still unresolved"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Stipend only"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Living support confirmed"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Tuition requires its own check"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Confirmed combined package"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Both instruments documented"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Review timing and continuation"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","5-Review the issued terms before accepting",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Review the issued terms before accepting"}],[["$","p","Make a final record of the award name, covered period, payment timing and continuation terms. Read any restrictions on employment, overlapping awards, leave or changes to candidature in the applicable agreement. These are contract-specific questions; this guide does not invent a universal permission to work or pause the scholarship.",{"children":"Make a final record of the award name, covered period, payment timing and continuation terms. Read any restrictions on employment, overlapping awards, leave or changes to candidature in the applicable agreement. These are contract-specific questions; this guide does not invent a universal permission to work or pause the scholarship."}],["$","p","If you accept, keep the admission decision, each funding decision and the relevant conditions together. Revisit the budget if the start date, campus or study mode changes. A careful package review helps you distinguish an affordable research plan from a promising application that still has an unresolved cost.",{"children":"If you accept, keep the admission decision, each funding decision and the relevant conditions together. Revisit the budget if the start date, campus or study mode changes. A careful package review helps you distinguish an affordable research plan from a promising application that still has an unresolved cost."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Review the issued terms before accepting","children":[["$","$L5","/countries/australia/",{"href":"/countries/australia/","children":["Compare Australian funding routes",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/find-phd-supervisor/",{"href":"/guides/find-phd-supervisor/","children":["Prepare a supervisor enquiry",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Build the research statement",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
